WEBVTT

00:05.780 --> 00:11.240
<i>Today, Zagan asked me if I wanted 
to be his and Nephy's daughter.</i>

00:11.680 --> 00:15.120
<i>It came as a big surprise, 
but to be honest...</i>

00:15.610 --> 00:16.910
<i>I was happy.</i>

00:19.690 --> 00:22.800
<i>Since coming to this 
castle full of mysteries,</i>

00:22.800 --> 00:25.120
<i>there's one thing I have figured out.</i>

00:25.440 --> 00:31.360
<i>I understand what this warm 
feeling in my chest is now.</i>

00:33.290 --> 00:36.230
<i>I like it here.</i>

00:37.220 --> 00:39.600
<i>I like it when Zagan pats my head.</i>

00:40.100 --> 00:42.680
<i>I like it when Nephy hugs me.</i>

00:43.130 --> 00:45.100
<i>The things Zagan teaches me,</i>

00:45.530 --> 00:46.980
<i>the things Nephy cooks,</i>

00:47.350 --> 00:49.180
<i>I love it all so much that...</i>

00:50.670 --> 00:55.050
<i>If I stay here, I'm going 
to forget about my revenge.</i>

00:55.050 --> 00:57.780
<i>I'm going to want to stay with 
the two of them, forever.</i>

00:59.780 --> 01:03.080
<i>Is my revenge really that flimsy?</i>

01:04.030 --> 01:07.750
<i>No. I can never forget about it.</i>

01:07.750 --> 01:09.970
<i>That's right! Don't forget!</i>

01:09.970 --> 01:11.710
<i>Don't let your hatred waver!</i>

01:14.340 --> 01:16.110
<i>And that's why I'm sorry.</i>

01:16.590 --> 01:18.880
<i>I can't stay here any longer.</i>

01:18.880 --> 01:25.020
<i>This concludes Valefor's 
Archdemon Observation Log.</i>

01:35.910 --> 01:40.030
<i>Thank you you for offering to 
make me your daughter, Zagan.</i>

01:40.330 --> 01:44.560
<i>For saying it was my decision, 
and that you'd always wait for me.</i>

01:45.790 --> 01:47.010
<i>Thank you.</i>

03:18.010 --> 03:23.010
<b>Episode 10: 
Of Course Parents Panic When Their
 Daughter Runs Away From Home</b>

03:50.480 --> 03:53.080
The Archdemon castle. Inside here...

03:53.600 --> 03:57.420
<i>I should be able to find enough power 
to kill a Sacred Sword wielder.</i>

03:57.830 --> 04:02.380
Since I came before, Zagan arranged 
it so I could get inside.

04:06.080 --> 04:10.500
<i>And if I sneak in and take things without 
him knowing, I'll be betraying him.</i>

04:11.070 --> 04:11.920
<i>But...</i>

04:11.920 --> 04:13.940
<i>I need power.</i>

04:14.430 --> 04:19.400
To think there'd be an Archdemon 
castle in a place like this.

04:20.570 --> 04:22.540
<i>Did he follow me?</i>

04:22.540 --> 04:23.700
<i>This scent...</i>

04:26.290 --> 04:27.320
<i>A Sacred Sword!</i>

04:28.610 --> 04:30.950
It's you!

04:47.460 --> 04:48.980
And you are?

04:48.980 --> 04:51.970
I've never met a little girl like you before.

04:56.650 --> 04:59.150
Bastard!

05:03.780 --> 05:07.630
<i>I should've known I wouldn't stand a chance 
against a Sacred Sword wielder without a plan.</i>

05:08.580 --> 05:09.280
<i>Zagan!</i>

05:10.380 --> 05:12.490
I know I said you could do what you want,

05:12.840 --> 05:15.080
but maybe you should have a curfew.

05:16.480 --> 05:21.420
So, you can stop my attack, Archdemon?

05:21.420 --> 05:23.590
Zagan, why?

05:23.590 --> 05:26.340
I had a convenient bit of 
transportation on hand,

05:26.340 --> 05:28.760
so I had him send me here since 
it was obvious where you'd go.

05:31.420 --> 05:34.350
I'm not convenient or your 
transportation, dammit.

05:35.320 --> 05:36.980
That's not what I mean!

05:36.980 --> 05:39.260
I betrayed you!

05:40.000 --> 05:42.270
But you... why?

05:42.270 --> 05:44.430
I told you I could understand how you felt.

05:44.430 --> 05:45.860
Stop worrying over every little thing.

05:55.190 --> 05:57.500
I'm sorry!

05:58.150 --> 05:59.960
<i>I'm glad I made it in time.</i>

06:00.720 --> 06:02.960
Lord Zagan! Is For all right?

06:02.960 --> 06:06.220
Yeah. We'll head back as soon as 
we've dealt with another matter.

06:06.570 --> 06:08.430
Wait there for us, Nephy.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.470
Understood.

06:12.050 --> 06:12.970
Now then,

06:12.970 --> 06:17.350
I did warn you about what'd happen 
if you stepped out bounds.

06:18.540 --> 06:21.060
A sorcerer, defending someone else?

06:21.060 --> 06:22.530
She's not just anyone.

06:23.110 --> 06:25.060
She is my daughter.

06:27.700 --> 06:30.660
I see. Your daughter, eh?

06:30.960 --> 06:33.160
That does sound like a suitable reason.

06:33.440 --> 06:35.450
For, give me some space.

06:36.540 --> 06:40.250
A word of warning: Defend with all 
you've got if you don't want to die.

06:40.490 --> 06:43.360
I didn't want this, but you leave me choice.

06:43.360 --> 06:46.670
It's not yet my time to die, after all.

06:46.670 --> 06:49.820
Answer my call, Sacred Sword Metatron!

06:55.890 --> 06:57.770
<i>My sorceries are being broken apart?</i>

06:57.770 --> 07:02.000
This blade once defeated an Archdemon 
and burned all their sorcery away

07:02.000 --> 07:03.710
with the flames of purification.

07:04.370 --> 07:08.280
An ability only accessible by a 
true wielder of a Sacred Sword.

07:08.280 --> 07:11.330
Whoa, whoa, what is this guy's deal?

07:11.330 --> 07:15.080
Zagan, why would you provoke 
him into getting serious?

07:15.380 --> 07:20.210
I promised you that I'd teach 
you how to get revenge.

07:20.670 --> 07:23.790
Drawing out your target's full 
potential and then crushing it.

07:23.790 --> 07:27.130
That's one of the ways 
to drive them to despair.

07:35.760 --> 07:37.930
<i>The casting spell isn't vanishing?!</i>

07:40.070 --> 07:43.400
A Sacred Sword had cut 
through one before, you see.

07:43.940 --> 07:47.030
I've learned from 
Archdemon Marchosias's legacy

07:47.030 --> 07:50.070
and used it to create new defensive measures.

07:50.380 --> 07:56.030
This spell continually draws in mana from 
the environment in order to maintain itself.

07:56.030 --> 07:58.040
Even your purifying flame...

08:02.500 --> 08:05.020
won't be enough to overcome it in an instant.

08:04.830 --> 08:08.380
<b>Heaven's 
Scale</b>

08:05.730 --> 08:08.380
I suppose I'll call it "Heaven's Scale."

08:14.000 --> 08:16.560
And you still manage to grip that sword?

08:16.560 --> 08:19.350
That would've been enough to 
break most people's arms.

08:25.740 --> 08:28.020
I'd appreciate it if you didn't 
make too much of a mess.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.330
Unbelievable...

08:42.600 --> 08:44.520
I guess it can only take three blows.

08:44.520 --> 08:49.670
A decent showing for a test, but it has a 
long way to go before considering it complete.

08:49.670 --> 08:52.970
Hey, dumbass! Quit trying to 
show off how easy you've got it!

08:56.370 --> 08:58.050
As I already told you before...

09:04.960 --> 09:07.150
This is called "confidence."

09:07.540 --> 09:11.870
With those flames of purification gone, 
I can use other sorcery, as well.

09:13.320 --> 09:15.070
<b>Whoaaa!</b>

09:13.570 --> 09:15.070
Whoaaa!

09:15.500 --> 09:18.200
<i>I'm not sure why, but I kind of like this.</i>

09:19.660 --> 09:22.120
Surely he can't stand anymore.

09:22.120 --> 09:24.800
Angelic Knights aren't like sorcerers.

09:24.800 --> 09:27.500
Even with the blessing 
of that anointed armor,

09:27.500 --> 09:31.310
a critical blow like that will 
take you out of the battle.

09:32.010 --> 09:34.380
I... see...

09:39.410 --> 09:41.430
You have incredible power.

09:42.230 --> 09:45.850
What exactly is he?

09:47.840 --> 09:48.650
Nephy!

09:49.000 --> 09:51.570
Where's Zagan? I'm going after him!

09:54.810 --> 09:56.900
This shadow...

09:57.280 --> 10:01.840
Lord Barbatos took Lord Zagan to For.

10:01.840 --> 10:03.790
And is For all right?!

10:04.180 --> 10:05.880
Yes. But...

10:05.880 --> 10:09.880
Lord Zagan is defending For from 
someone who was attacking her.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.470
Then I should go.

10:20.470 --> 10:23.670
<i>But it's my fault that 
For left in the first place.</i>

10:24.160 --> 10:25.470
I should go...

10:30.420 --> 10:32.150
<i>Go and then what?</i>

10:32.600 --> 10:35.910
<i>The Church is likely to kill me now,</i>

10:35.910 --> 10:39.400
<i>so I side with sorcerers, instead?</i>

10:39.400 --> 10:42.750
<i>That's just... pure selfishness.</i>

10:42.750 --> 10:43.960
Miss Chastille?

10:45.120 --> 10:46.530
Are you alright?

10:46.530 --> 10:48.700
Are you not going?

10:49.700 --> 10:52.920
Lord Zagan told me to wait here.

10:55.530 --> 10:58.630
This probably isn't an appropriate time,

10:59.100 --> 11:02.140
but I envy you a bit.

11:02.960 --> 11:05.850
I envy you, too, Miss Chastille.

11:08.030 --> 11:09.520
How could you possibly...

11:09.520 --> 11:12.570
Because you can go after Lord Zagan.

11:13.690 --> 11:16.320
He is very powerful.

11:16.640 --> 11:18.940
He may not need any help.

11:19.200 --> 11:22.660
but even then, if I could stand 
at his side to help him...

11:22.910 --> 11:24.490
But I'm his enemy!

11:24.490 --> 11:28.080
If you want to go, you should 
ignore his orders and—

11:28.080 --> 11:29.580
I cannot do that.

11:38.760 --> 11:45.050
Because I believe my duty is to be 
here to welcome Lord Zagan home.

11:46.000 --> 11:50.890
I know it's stupid to claim to be your enemy 
after you've both helped me so much...

11:51.640 --> 11:52.390
Right.

11:53.240 --> 11:55.480
Even I...

11:56.100 --> 11:58.550
would like to help him if I thought I could.

11:59.680 --> 12:03.110
But I'm an Angelic Knight.

12:04.120 --> 12:04.850
Yes.

12:05.570 --> 12:07.740
I don't know what to do anymore.

12:08.270 --> 12:11.750
Being poisoned has bothered 
me more than I thought.

12:12.410 --> 12:16.910
I keep wondering what purpose 
my sword even has anymore.

12:16.910 --> 12:17.750
Right.

12:20.140 --> 12:23.230
I didn't want to turn my 
blade against Zagan...

12:24.140 --> 12:27.010
I wanted to fight by his side!

12:34.240 --> 12:36.400
It sounds like you know what to do.

12:37.020 --> 12:38.650
When we first talked,

12:39.390 --> 12:44.320
you said that Lord Zagan 
seemed lonely to you.

12:44.750 --> 12:47.410
I was honestly kind of envious.

12:48.030 --> 12:53.250
Because I thought I was the only one 
who could understand Lord Zagan.

12:53.930 --> 12:55.900
But at the same time, I was happy.

12:56.440 --> 13:00.300
Because it meant there are people out 
there who can understand Lord Zagan.

13:02.820 --> 13:05.860
You really have gotten stronger.

13:06.320 --> 13:09.470
By loving and being loved by Zagan...

13:10.060 --> 13:12.020
Are you all right, now?

13:12.020 --> 13:13.660
Oh, yes...

13:14.060 --> 13:18.060
Wait, were you trying to comfort me?

13:18.460 --> 13:20.670
Did I not do a good job?

13:20.670 --> 13:22.570
That's not what I meant!

13:22.940 --> 13:26.200
It's just, why go so far for me?

13:26.760 --> 13:27.700
Well...

13:28.010 --> 13:30.700
We're friends, aren't we?

13:35.940 --> 13:37.920
Thank you, Nephy.

13:38.950 --> 13:40.170
I'm going.

13:40.170 --> 13:43.130
Right. Good luck, Miss Chastille.

13:43.500 --> 13:45.510
No more doubts!

13:49.970 --> 13:54.980
<b>An Archdemon's Dilemma:
How to Love Your Elf Bride</b>

14:10.820 --> 14:13.270
<i>His wounds are healing.</i>

14:13.270 --> 14:17.040
<i>It looks like the rumors about dragon flesh 
granting special powers were true.</i>

14:17.040 --> 14:18.780
Congratulations, For.

14:18.780 --> 14:21.370
It seems he won't die easily.

14:21.370 --> 14:23.860
You should start thinking about 
how you intend to punish him.

14:24.760 --> 14:25.240
Right.

14:27.280 --> 14:30.720
I seem to be rather hated.

14:31.020 --> 14:33.850
My father... was my pride and joy.

14:34.470 --> 14:35.960
The Sage Dragon, Orobas.

14:36.540 --> 14:38.560
That's the name of the dragon you killed!

14:42.510 --> 14:45.130
The legendary dragon who 
lived for a millennia...

14:45.680 --> 14:48.040
<i>And he was For's Father?</i>

14:48.810 --> 14:52.330
<i>Could a dragon like that really 
have been killed by this man?</i>

14:54.660 --> 14:58.340
My father used his wisdom 
to help the people,

14:58.340 --> 15:01.920
and for his guidance, they called 
him the Sage Dragon, Orobas.

15:03.050 --> 15:07.190
One day, a group of Angelic Knights
 came calling on him.

15:07.190 --> 15:09.930
I didn't know what they wanted.

15:10.470 --> 15:16.470
But my father left with those 
knights and never returned home.

15:17.280 --> 15:20.940
After seven days, I decided 
to search for him.

15:21.640 --> 15:24.590
What I found...

15:29.150 --> 15:32.690
was a Sacred Sword stabbed 
into my father's corpse

15:32.690 --> 15:36.660
and a demonic-looking man 
drinking his blood!

15:48.100 --> 15:49.450
Father...

15:50.590 --> 15:51.350
Fa...

15:51.350 --> 15:56.850
My father had shared his power and 
wisdom with humans, so many times.

15:58.610 --> 15:59.720
And then...

16:00.240 --> 16:02.440
You betrayed him!

16:04.720 --> 16:08.070
I see. You're the daughter of Orobas.

16:08.650 --> 16:09.690
In that case...

16:09.690 --> 16:11.860
I must see you slain!

16:13.280 --> 16:14.990
That's not going to happen!

16:25.880 --> 16:26.880
Wha—?!

16:26.880 --> 16:27.710
He's...

16:27.710 --> 16:29.670
Just try it!

16:29.670 --> 16:30.840
For, don't!

16:44.250 --> 16:47.310
Enough is enough, Sir Raphael.

16:47.310 --> 16:49.940
Tail-Head?! How did you get here?

16:50.240 --> 16:52.940
Oh, damn, I forgot to close the shadow.

16:52.940 --> 16:54.200
Chastille!

16:54.560 --> 16:58.450
<i>She was able to stop Raphael's sword 
and For's sorcery at the same time!</i>

16:59.100 --> 17:00.410
What do you think you're doing?

17:00.700 --> 17:03.580
For all the grief you've given me,

17:03.580 --> 17:06.920
I was the one who intruded upon your home.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.880
But at least once...

17:09.170 --> 17:11.130
Can we just talk civilly?

17:12.260 --> 17:15.710
Well, it's about time that 
you manage to do that much.

17:16.160 --> 17:17.680
But first...

17:22.920 --> 17:24.310
What do you think you're doing?

17:24.670 --> 17:27.520
I'm a sorcerer. A villain.

17:27.520 --> 17:31.630
I couldn't care less if an Angelic 
Knight dies, but this is disturbing.

17:31.630 --> 17:33.440
What are you trying to accomplish?

17:35.210 --> 17:39.870
There's no enjoyment to be gained from 
killing someone who's practically begging to die.

17:43.040 --> 17:44.660
What do you mean?

17:44.660 --> 17:46.880
I don't know, which is why I'm asking.

17:46.880 --> 17:50.380
The second he heard the name Orobas, 
all his bloodlust disappeared.

17:51.340 --> 17:53.200
W-Wait, Zagan...

17:53.200 --> 17:56.670
Come on. If you get involved this 
is going to get even more...

17:56.670 --> 17:57.930
Not that!

17:58.570 --> 18:02.310
This is hard to believe but... 
it was you, wasn't it?

18:03.260 --> 18:07.020
You're the one who summoned 
me with that letter.

18:07.020 --> 18:09.940
You're "Orobas" of the 
reconciliation faction, aren't you?

18:13.060 --> 18:16.570
You did mention Orobas before.

18:16.850 --> 18:21.780
<i>I had thought it unlikely that someone from the
 Church would bring up the legendary dragon...</i>

18:22.100 --> 18:23.900
Let's hear your explanation.

18:23.900 --> 18:25.620
What's she talking about, Zagan?

18:32.270 --> 18:33.250
Zagan...

18:33.250 --> 18:34.550
I know.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.800
Something... is coming.

18:49.850 --> 18:52.310
What is this miasma?

18:53.480 --> 18:55.840
Wh-Whoa, what the hell is going on?!

18:55.840 --> 18:56.940
How should I know?!

19:02.010 --> 19:02.830
What is that thing?!

19:05.290 --> 19:06.540
The miasma...

19:07.390 --> 19:08.460
Is it a demon?!

19:09.600 --> 19:10.330
No.

19:10.680 --> 19:13.410
I don't feel the same kind of terror.

19:13.410 --> 19:16.210
Is it a golem that was 
modeled after a demon?

19:17.340 --> 19:21.470
It's absorbing mana from 
its surroundings to power itself.

19:21.470 --> 19:25.930
People, the environment... it's going 
to drain everything dry at this rate.

19:27.250 --> 19:28.430
Zagan!

19:28.830 --> 19:32.050
That's the guardian of 
the Archdemon's castle!

19:32.690 --> 19:37.780
You're right! The shock wave from the 
Sacred Swords clashing must've broken the seal!

19:37.780 --> 19:39.780
Impossible...

19:39.780 --> 19:41.840
It's the Archdemon's legacy?!

19:41.840 --> 19:43.680
Hey, Zagan, what do we do?!

19:43.680 --> 19:46.030
This thing is gonna devour 
us all at this rate!

19:46.030 --> 19:47.530
Settle down!

19:48.000 --> 19:50.700
By my Archdemon crest, I command you..

19:50.700 --> 19:53.540
Begone! Return to whence you came!

19:58.600 --> 20:00.800
I guess it doesn't work on a golem.

20:09.230 --> 20:09.980
Get clear!

20:18.190 --> 20:19.070
For!

20:35.750 --> 20:37.170
Why?

20:43.290 --> 20:45.330
You misshapen puppet.

20:45.330 --> 20:47.220
I've had enough of you.

20:51.020 --> 20:53.520
Now, shatter! Heaven's Scale!

21:02.880 --> 21:04.110
For! Are you all right?!

21:04.540 --> 21:06.580
I'm okay.

21:06.580 --> 21:07.530
But...

21:10.100 --> 21:12.560
<i>The wound's too close to his heart.</i>

21:12.560 --> 21:14.710
<i>Even with the dragon's power, this...</i>

21:15.540 --> 21:16.460
Why?

21:17.020 --> 21:20.760
All I've done... is my duty.

21:21.600 --> 21:23.560
It's no concern of yours.

21:26.930 --> 21:27.840
Don't move!

21:28.400 --> 21:30.660
<i>Why is he trying to stand?</i>

21:31.590 --> 21:36.470
It's clear you're attempting 
some kind of redemption.

21:36.470 --> 21:38.940
But I can tell there's more to it.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.940
Tell us everything, Raphael.

23:30.010 --> 23:35.010
<b>Next Time: 
It's Still Apparently an Angelic Knight's 
Duty To Slay Wicked Beasts</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>If she had 
shown up 
in a maid 
uniform</b>
